# ml-tech-digest

A digest of the machine-learning technologies covered in the office ML
reading-group playlist.

The catalog lives in [ml_tech.md](ml_tech.md). It lists each technology, the
original GitHub repository of the open-source project behind it, and a short
summary of what that project does.

Source playlist:
https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PlyzTA8cetPdHtlGw1X8Kt7Ea4bd27ApR7
